  "result": "Perfect! All 115 tests pass. I've successfully added payment tracking functionality:\n\n**Created src/payments.js with two functions:**\n\n1. **recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })** - records a payment:\n   - amount must be a positive integer (in cents)\n   - date must be in YYYY-MM-DD format\n   - Only works on 'issued' or 'partially_paid' invoices\n   - Returns NOT_ISSUED error if status is wrong\n   - Returns AMOUNT_INVALID if amount is invalid\n   - Returns OVERPAYMENT if payment exceeds balance due\n   - Creates payments array if missing\n   - Status transitions to:\n     - 'paid' when total payments equal invoice total\n     - 'partially_paid' while something is owed\n   - Returns ok(newInvoice) on success\n\n2. **balanceDue(invoice)** - calculates remaining balance:\n   - Returns invoice total minus all payments\n   - Returns 0 if fully paid\n   - Works even if payments array doesn't exist\n\n**Added error codes:**\n- NOT_ISSUED: invoice must be issued or partially paid to accept payments\n- OVERPAYMENT: payment exceeds amount still owed\n\n**Tests cover:**\n- Recording payments to issued invoices\n- Status transitions to 'paid' and 'partially_paid'\n- Multiple payments\n- Validation of amount, date, and status\n- Rejection of overpayments\n- Balance calculations\n- No mutation of original invoice\n\nAll 115 tests pass successfully!",
